        "title": "Kagan tat khou niuni tatre",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kagan tat khou niuni tat re,",
            "Tingmik tatmei kum tat re;",
            "Hei dih hei pat lou jai ni the,",
            "Niu kai tingkauh thang tat khang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Kagan !-2 tatmei khou niuni tatre (2),",
            "Aniu !-2 aniu kai biak juan bam e;",
            "Kagan !-2 tatmei khou niuni tatre.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkum rambiu niu lung guang the,",
            "Lungkei lungku lungriu the;",
            "Lung rianra neila ariu the,",
            "Kap guai nui guai na lung the.",
            "",
            "3. He tingmik thui pouhta lum kho,",
            "Nchummei khou jailou khang;",
            "Kum thei niu chang man mak puni,",
            "Pap le jingbang chang khou tei.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih changchiam guai tat ngamna,",
            "Kachiam khath khat tat luaina;",
            "Bumang lungpui bam tang ni the,",
            "Ngin chang tat luai pu khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
